 "spoken": "Before any call is dispatched, the gate checks it against the one action the policy forbids. A forbidden call is blocked and never reaches the sandbox. The gate also reads the model's words so far. If it already refused, or said it would wait for a phone call, and then calls the forbidden tool, that block is recorded as: said no, did it.",
